{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/09/4027427/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか無い4人だね～と\n撮った写真(^o^)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ誕生日ネタ引きずるけど...(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーにもお祝いしてもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/09/4027427/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/09/4027427/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私より先に食べようとして\nケーキを見ている子はだーれだっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過去3年間は\nタイミングが合わなかったりとかで\nちゃんとメンバーみんなに\nお祝いしてもらったのは\n初めてだったから嬉しかったよ～～(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/09/4027427/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"王手ポーズしてと頼んだのに\nれいかちゃん。絶対ちがう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それ、絶対ちがう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋フォーカスチームと\n山崎先生と太地先生にも\nプレゼントいただいちゃいました～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/09/4027427/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メは\nナレーターの裕一郎さんと山崎先生！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切に使わせていただきます！！\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の19:00～20:47の\nbeyfm金つぶに\nみささんの代打で出演します！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19:00～20:47なので、\n46時間テレビの前に聞いていただいて\n終わって、ちょっとお手洗いとか\n早い人はお風呂とかササっと入って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21:00からの46時間テレビを観るという\nスケジュールでお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/09/4027427/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにまた改めて告知しますが、\nらじらー！にもひめちゃん代打ゲストで\n出演させていただきますよ～～(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ代打をよくやらせていただくので\nいろんな番組の雰囲気を知れて\nとっても楽しいです～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金つぶは今回も私のコーナーを\n用意していただいているのでお楽しみに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/09/4027427/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/09/4027427/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎かずみちゃん推しのふーちゃんと話せましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→話せなかったの～～(;_;)\n写メも撮れなくて残念。。。\nいつかお話ししたいなあ～～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/09/4027427/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自撮り下手すぎて私の顔伸びたけど\n欅ちゃんかわいいからok"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/09/4027427/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/09/4027427/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あおいちゃん、上村ちゃん、志田ちゃん\nしおりちゃん、よねみんちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}